# RESPONSIVE DESIGN

This is extremely important.

The application must work exceptionally well on:

* Windows desktop
* laptop
* tablet
* mobile

Desktop and mobile should NOT simply be the same layout scaled down.

Use responsive layouts intentionally.

Desktop:

* persistent sidebar
* multi-column layouts where appropriate
* tables
* dashboard cards
* large content areas

Mobile:

* drawer/collapsible navigation
* stacked cards
* mobile-friendly forms
* large touch targets
* simplified menus
* horizontally scrollable content only when genuinely necessary
* no clipped text
* no overflowing containers

Test mentally and structurally against:

1440px
1280px
1024px
768px
390px
360px

